    "text": "THE SEASON OF LENT AND HOLY WEEK AT CALVARY SHRINE, MAGGONA IN THE CATHOLIC DIOCESE OF KALUTARA (WESTERN PROVINCE)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      461.88,
      542.51,
      499.35
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified to the general public that the Annual Lent and Holy Week Season held at the Calvary Shrine, Maggona situated in the Divisional Secretariat Division, Beruwala in 741 B Kapugoda Grama Niladhari Division of the Kalutara Administrative District, Western Province will continue as usual from 18th February 2026 to 05th April 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.01,
      509.88,
      542.43,
      535.35
    ],
    "text": "The regulations published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2018/06 and dated 08.05.2017 in terms of the Pilgrimages Ordinance will be enforced during this Holy season.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
